{"bg_img":"https:\/\/www.sinopeg.com.cn\/uploadfile\/image\/20240823\/20240823154136_34555.png","category_id":"6a157626b0cd2e35d86fcf74","column_id":"6a154fc77093015d5705df9a","create_time":"2024-08-21 15:37:21","details":"<p>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p style=\"color:#3E3E3E;font-family:;\">\r\n\t<img src=\"https:\/\/img1.dxycdn.com\/p\/s14\/2024\/0807\/540\/8676353947355990281.png\" width=\"500\" height=\"250\" =\"\"=\"\" align=\"\" alt=\"\">\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p style=\"color:#3E3E3E;font-family:;\">\r\n\t2-arm PEG-MAL，中文名称为双臂聚乙二醇马来酰亚胺，英文全称为2-arm Polyethylene Glycol Maleimide，分子量视具体结构而定。\r\n<\/p>\r\n<h3 style=\"font-size:12px;color:#3E3E3E;font-family:;\">\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<h3 style=\"font-size:12px;color:#3E3E3E;font-family:;\">\r\n\t<strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><br \/>\r\n<\/span><\/strong>\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<h3 style=\"font-size:12px;color:#3E3E3E;font-family:;\">\r\n\t<strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">分子结构与特性<\/span><\/strong> \r\n<\/h3>\r\n<p style=\"color:#3E3E3E;font-family:;\">\r\n\t2-arm PEG-MAL由两个聚乙二醇（PEG）臂组成，每个臂末端连接有马来酰亚胺（Maleimide，MAL）官能团。这种设计结构使其具有以下显著特点：\r\n<\/p>\r\n<ol style=\"color:#3E3E3E;font-family:;\">\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t\t<strong>聚乙二醇（PEG）基础<\/strong>：长链的PEG提供了优异的水溶性和生物相容性，适合用作生物医学材料的载体。\r\n\t<\/li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t\t<strong>马来酰亚胺（MAL）官能团<\/strong>：MAL官能团具有特定的化学反应性，可以与含有巯基的生物分子发生Michael加成反应，用于交联和功能化修饰材料。\r\n\t<\/li>\r\n<\/ol>\r\n<h3 style=\"font-size:12px;color:#3E3E3E;font-family:;\">\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<h3 style=\"font-size:12px;color:#3E3E3E;font-family:;\">\r\n\t<strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><br \/>\r\n<\/span><\/strong>\r\n<\/h3>\r\n<h3 style=\"font-size:12px;color:#3E3E3E;font-family:;\">\r\n\t<strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">应用领域<\/span><\/strong> \r\n<\/h3>\r\n<p style=\"color:#3E3E3E;font-family:;\">\r\n\t2-arm PEG-MAL在生物医学领域中有多种重要应用：\r\n<\/p>\r\n<ul style=\"color:#3E3E3E;font-family:;\">\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t\t<strong>药物传递系统<\/strong>：作为药物的载体，通过化学反应控制药物的释放，提高药物的效果和减少毒副作用。\r\n\t<\/li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t\t<strong>生物材料功能化修饰<\/strong>：通过MAL官能团连接到生物材料表面，增强其生物相容性和生物活性分子的载体能力。\r\n\t<\/li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t\t<strong>生物传感器和诊断工具<\/strong>：利用其精确的化学反应性，开发用于检测生物标志物或诊断疾病的高灵敏度和特异性生物传感器。\r\n\t<\/li>\r\n<\/ul>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<div class=\"Post-RichTextContainer\" style=\"margin:0px auto;color:#191B1F;font-family:-apple-system, MacSystemFont, \" font-size:medium;background-color:#ffffff;\"=\"\">\r\n<div class=\"css-1od93p9\">\r\n\t<div class=\"css-376mun\">\r\n\t\t<div class=\"RichText ztext Post-RichText css-1ygg4xu\">\r\n\t\t\t<h3 style=\"font-style:inherit;font-size:1.1em;font-family:inherit;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">相关推荐：<\/span> \r\n\t\t\t<\/h3>\r\n\t\t\t<table style=\"font-size:15px;margin:1.4em auto;width:690px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<tbody>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<th style=\"border:1px solid #C4C7CE;background:#EBECED;color:#191B1F;font-weight:500;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t中文名称\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/th>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<th style=\"border:1px solid #C4C7CE;background:#EBECED;color:#191B1F;font-weight:500;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t简称\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/th>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"border:1px solid #C4C7CE;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t两臂聚乙二醇羟基\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/td>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"border:1px solid #C4C7CE;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2-arm PEG-OH\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/td>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"border:1px solid #C4C7CE;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t两臂聚乙二醇羧酸\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/td>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"border:1px solid #C4C7CE;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2-arm PEG-COOH\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/td>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"border:1px solid #C4C7CE;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t两臂聚乙二醇<span style=\"color:#000000;\">琥珀酰亚胺<\/span>羧酸酯\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/td>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"border:1px solid #C4C7CE;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t2-arm PEG-NHS\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/td>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"border:1px solid #C4C7CE;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t两臂聚乙二醇马来酰